  "provenance": {
    "source_notes": "Reference for this template's layout, text, and colors came from a clean, isolated plate texture the Forza Writer user supplied -- one of a set of thirteen originally extracted from GTA V's companion iFruit app (not this app's own game files, and not a screenshot taken in-game) and posted publicly to Reddit by u/sgtfrankieboy. A brand tie-in novelty plate for Sprunk, GTA's fictional soft-drink brand. The real design is considerably more elaborate than this schema can represent: a green halftone/polka-dot textured gradient background, a decorative bubble graphic and swoosh beneath the wordmark, and a bold white bubble-letter 'Sprunk' logotype with a small 'The Essence of Life' tagline above it -- only the flat background color, the wordmark text, and the tagline text are modeled; the texture, bubbles, and swoosh are omitted entirely (no pattern/gradient/decorative-graphic primitive in this schema, same treatment as every other branded/emblem plate in this set, e.g. cp2077-nightcity's own emblem). Green background sampled directly (#99C335); the bubble-letter logotype's own style isn't reproducible either way (placeholder boxes only). Two empty corner sticker boxes -- these render as solid black in the reference image, which most likely means transparency/cutout in the original asset rather than an actual black sticker, so modeled as plain white boxes matching every other template's empty-sticker convention instead of guessing black is meaningful.",
